      <h2 id="cert-manager-config-metrics-collection_cert-manager-monitoring" class="group scroll-mt-20">Configuring metrics collection for the istio-csr operand<a href="#cert-manager-config-metrics-collection_cert-manager-monitoring" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
